       UTILITY-SECTION SECTION.
       RECORD-TRANSACTION.
           MOVE WS-INPUT-ACCOUNT TO TRANS-ACCOUNT-NUMBER
           IF WS-OPTION = "3"
               MOVE "CREDIT" TO TRANS-TYPE
           ELSE
               MOVE "DEBIT " TO TRANS-TYPE
           END-IF
           MOVE WS-INPUT-AMOUNT TO TRANS-AMOUNT
           PERFORM BUILD-DATETIME
           MOVE WS-DATETIME-FORMATTED TO TRANS-DATETIME
           MOVE "00" TO WS-TRANSACTION-STATUS
           OPEN EXTEND TRANSACTION-FILE
           WRITE TRANSACTION-RECORD
           IF WS-TRANSACTION-STATUS NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "Failed to record transaction. STATUS: "
                   WS-TRANSACTION-STATUS
           END-IF
           CLOSE TRANSACTION-FILE
           MOVE "00" TO WS-TRANSACTION-STATUS.

       BUILD-DATETIME.
           ACCEPT WS-CURRENT-DATE-RAW FROM DATE YYYYMMDD
           ACCEPT WS-CURRENT-TIME-RAW FROM TIME
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-DATETIME-FORMATTED
           STRING
               WS-CURRENT-DATE-RAW(1:4) DELIMITED BY SIZE
               "-" DELIMITED BY SIZE
               WS-CURRENT-DATE-RAW(5:2) DELIMITED BY SIZE
               "-" DELIMITED BY SIZE
               WS-CURRENT-DATE-RAW(7:2) DELIMITED BY SIZE
               " " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               WS-CURRENT-TIME-RAW(1:2) DELIMITED BY SIZE
               ":" DELIMITED BY SIZE
               WS-CURRENT-TIME-RAW(3:2) DELIMITED BY SIZE
               ":" DELIMITED BY SIZE
               WS-CURRENT-TIME-RAW(5:2) DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO WS-DATETIME-FORMATTED
           END-STRING.

